# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for Vega's tests.
#
# Swift's swift_continuation_await (stdlib/public/Concurrency/Task.cpp) has no
# _swift_tsan_acquire on its early-resume paths: when a continuation is
# resumed before its task reaches the await, the task carries on without
# TSan seeing the resumer's _swift_tsan_release. The task's next write to its
# own continuation frame is then reported as racing with the resumer's
# resume(returning:). Present in Swift 6.3.3 and on main as of 2026-10-11.
# Only reports whose top frame is the compiler-generated body of
# withUnsafeContinuation itself are suppressed.
race_top:ss22withUnsafeContinuation9isolation_
